WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Nobody tells you what they failed to find.

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.900
So you never learn whether it is quiet out there or they just did not look.

3
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:21.900
Nothing on Hacker News. Here are the three searches we ran.

4
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.900
Repeat them in two minutes and see for yourself.

5
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:35.900
And it says the silence proves nothing here.

6
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:43.100
Hacker News is software people. For a farming tool they were never going to be talking.

7
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:50.700
Somewhere with nothing to say about farming is left out entirely.

8
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:56.700
Padding the list would make a thin search look thorough.

9
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:04.700
X, LinkedIn and Reddit are not licensed to us.

10
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:11.000
So we say so, and hand you the searches. You know what we did not look at.

11
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.000
The questions it raises are next.
